# Agent Skills (project)

Full pack lives under `vendor/agent-skills/`. **Do not load every skill into the reply.** For non-trivial work: read `vendor/agent-skills/skills/using-agent-skills/SKILL.md` once, then open only the skill(s) that match the task and follow them end-to-end (steps, verification, anti-rationalization tables).

## Skill entrypoints (`skills/<id>/SKILL.md`)

| Phase | Skill id | When |
|-------|-----------|------|
| Meta | `using-agent-skills` | Pick workflow, shared operating rules |
| Define | `idea-refine` | Vague idea → concrete proposal |
| Define | `spec-driven-development` | PRD/spec before code |
| Plan | `planning-and-task-breakdown` | Spec → small tasks + acceptance |
| Build | `incremental-implementation` | Multi-file / vertical slices |
| Build | `test-driven-development` | Logic, behavior, bugfix |
| Build | `context-engineering` | Session start, weak output, context packing |
| Build | `source-driven-development` | Framework decisions need official docs |
| Build | `doubt-driven-development` | High stakes, unfamiliar code |
| Build | `frontend-ui-engineering` | UI, a11y, design systems |
| Build | `api-and-interface-design` | APIs, public contracts, boundaries |
| Verify | `browser-testing-with-devtools` | Browser runtime, DOM, network |
| Verify | `debugging-and-error-recovery` | Failing tests, broken builds, wrong behavior |
| Review | `code-review-and-quality` | Pre-merge review |
| Review | `code-simplification` | Works but too complex |
| Review | `security-and-hardening` | Auth, input, secrets, OWASP |
| Review | `performance-optimization` | Perf requirements or suspected regressions |
| Ship | `git-workflow-and-versioning` | Commits, branch hygiene |
| Ship | `ci-cd-and-automation` | Pipelines, gates, flags |
| Ship | `deprecation-and-migration` | Sunsetting, migrations |
| Ship | `documentation-and-adrs` | ADRs, API docs, why |
| Ship | `shipping-and-launch` | Prod rollout, monitoring, rollback |

Path pattern: `vendor/agent-skills/skills/<id>/SKILL.md`.

